<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#f90e45e428558a03f6cef1f2dc697fa2>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "длится в течение"@ru , "ongoing throughout"@en , "abrange no mínimo"@pt , "a couvert"@fr , "andauernd während"@de , "最短范围是"@zh , "This property associates an instance of E52 Time-Span with an instance of E61 Time Primitive specifying a minimum period of time covered by it. Since Time-Spans may not have precisely known temporal extents, the CIDOC CRM supports statements about the minimum and maximum temporal extents of Time-Spans. This property allows a Time-Span’s minimum temporal extent (i.e., its inner boundary) to be assigned an E61 Time Primitive value. Time Primitives are treated by the CIDOC CRM as application or system specific date intervals, and are not further analysed. If different sources of evidence justify different minimum extents without contradicting each other, the smallest interval including all these extents will be the best estimate. This should be taken into account for information integration."@en , "καθόλη τη διάρκεια του/της"@el ;
        sh:datatype     rdfs:Literal ;
        sh:description  "This property associates an instance of E52 Time-Span with an instance of E61 Time Primitive specifying a minimum period of time covered by it. Since Time-Spans may not have precisely known temporal extents, the CIDOC CRM supports statements about the minimum and maximum temporal extents of Time-Spans. This property allows a Time-Span’s minimum temporal extent (i.e., its inner boundary) to be assigned an E61 Time Primitive value. Time Primitives are treated by the CIDOC CRM as application or system specific date intervals, and are not further analysed. If different sources of evidence justify different minimum extents without contradicting each other, the smallest interval including all these extents will be the best estimate. This should be taken into account for information integration."@en ;
        sh:name         "ongoing throughout"@en , "a couvert"@fr , "длится в течение"@ru , "最短范围是"@zh , "καθόλη τη διάρκεια του/της"@el , "abrange no mínimo"@pt , "andauernd während"@de ;
