<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#e8e4a51eff2965cac7f51ba6bb6f8e6b>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "consists of"@en , "состоит из"@ru , "consiste de"@pt , "besteht aus"@de , "αποτελείται από"@el , "This property describes the decomposition of an instance of E3 Condition State into discrete, subsidiary states.\nIt is assumed that the sub-states into which the condition state is analysed form a logical whole, although the entire story may not be completely known, and that the sub-states are in fact constitutive of the general condition state. For example, a general condition state of “in ruins” may be decomposed into the individual stages of decay.\nThis property is transitive and asymmetric."@en , "comprend"@fr , "包括"@zh ;
        sh:class        cidoc-crm:E3_Condition_State ;
        sh:description  "This property describes the decomposition of an instance of E3 Condition State into discrete, subsidiary states.\nIt is assumed that the sub-states into which the condition state is analysed form a logical whole, although the entire story may not be completely known, and that the sub-states are in fact constitutive of the general condition state. For example, a general condition state of “in ruins” may be decomposed into the individual stages of decay.\nThis property is transitive and asymmetric."@en ;
