        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "This property associates an instance of E2 Temporal Entity with the instance of E52 Time-Span during which it was on-going. The associated instance of E52 Time-Span is understood as the real time-span during which the phenomena making up the temporal entity instance were active. More than one instance of E2 Temporal Entity may share a common instance of E52 Time-Span only if they come into being and end being due to identical declarations or events."@en , "βρισκόταν σε εξέλιξη"@el , "tem período de tempo"@pt , "发生时段是"@zh , "имеет временной отрезок"@ru , "has time-span"@en , "hat Zeitspanne"@de , "a pour intervalle temporel"@fr ;
