        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "μετακινήθηκε προς"@el , "a déplacé vers"@fr , "移至"@zh , "This property identifies a destination, an instance of E53 Place, of an instance of E9 Move.\nA move will be linked to a destination, such as the move of an artifact from storage to display. A move may be linked to many terminal instances of E53 Place by multiple instances of this property. In this case the move describes a distribution of a set of objects. The area of the move includes the origin(s), route and destination(s).\nTherefore, the described destination is an instance of E53 Place which P89 falls within (contains) the instance of E53 Place the move P7 took place at."@en , "bewegte bis zu"@de , "locomoveu para"@pt , "перемещен в"@ru , "moved to"@en ;
