<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#27cf1ec7661c9bf56ecd5260bb809f86>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "a eu lieu durant"@fr , "некоторое время в течение"@ru , "irgendwann innerhalb von"@de , "abrange no máximo"@pt , "最长范围是"@zh , "at some time within"@en , "This property describes the maximum period of time within which an E52 Time-Span falls. Since Time-Spans may not have precisely known temporal extents, the CIDOC CRM supports statements about the minimum and maximum temporal extents of Time-Spans. This property allows a Time-Span’s maximum temporal extent (i.e. its outer boundary) to be assigned an E61 Time Primitive value. Time Primitives are treated by the CIDOC CRM as application or system specific date intervals, and are not further analysed. If different sources of evidence justify different maximum extents without contradicting each other, the resulting intersection of all these extents will be the best estimate. This should be taken into account for information integration."@en , "κάποτε εντός"@el ;
        sh:datatype     rdfs:Literal ;
        sh:description  "This property describes the maximum period of time within which an E52 Time-Span falls. Since Time-Spans may not have precisely known temporal extents, the CIDOC CRM supports statements about the minimum and maximum temporal extents of Time-Spans. This property allows a Time-Span’s maximum temporal extent (i.e. its outer boundary) to be assigned an E61 Time Primitive value. Time Primitives are treated by the CIDOC CRM as application or system specific date intervals, and are not further analysed. If different sources of evidence justify different maximum extents without contradicting each other, the resulting intersection of all these extents will be the best estimate. This should be taken into account for information integration."@en ;
        sh:name         "κάποτε εντός"@el , "最长范围是"@zh , "некоторое время в течение"@ru , "a eu lieu durant"@fr , "irgendwann innerhalb von"@de , "abrange no máximo"@pt , "at some time within"@en ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:Literal ;
        sh:path         cidoc-crm:P82_at_some_time_within .

<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#6b90d45b78ef6f3cfb5d88a0690b44d2>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "R27 materialized"@en , "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of F32 Item Production Event with the set of signs provided by the publisher to be carried by all of the produced items (i.e., the instances of F5 Item) and any other physical features foreseen as integral to the instance of F3 Manifestation that is materialised.\n\nExamples:\n- The production of copies of the paperback edition of the HarperCollins 2017 publication ‘Murder on the Orient Express / Agatha Christie’ (F32) materialized the publication ‘Murder on the Orient Express / Agatha Christie’ published by HarperCollins 2017 (F3).\n- The printing of the score of Bach’s ‘Goldberg Variations’ by Balthasar Schmid in 1741 (F32) materialized the publication Bach’s ‘Goldberg Variations’ as published by Balthasar Schmid in 1741 (F3).\n"@en ;
        sh:class        lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of F32 Item Production Event with the set of signs provided by the publisher to be carried by all of the produced items (i.e., the instances of F5 Item) and any other physical features foreseen as integral to the instance of F3 Manifestation that is materialised.\n\nExamples:\n- The production of copies of the paperback edition of the HarperCollins 2017 publication ‘Murder on the Orient Express / Agatha Christie’ (F32) materialized the publication ‘Murder on the Orient Express / Agatha Christie’ published by HarperCollins 2017 (F3).\n- The printing of the score of Bach’s ‘Goldberg Variations’ by Balthasar Schmid in 1741 (F32) materialized the publication Bach’s ‘Goldberg Variations’ as published by Balthasar Schmid in 1741 (F3).\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "R27 materialized"@en ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         lrmoo:R27_materialized .

<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#4229e2aac1860c4e9e2f98ec19899ac1>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "This property records an instance of E54 Dimension of some instance of E70 Thing.\nIn the case that the recorded property is a result of a measurement of an instance of E18 Physical Thing, this property is a shortcut of the more fully developed path from E18 Physical Thing through P39i was measured by, E16 Measurement, P40 observed dimension to E54 Dimension.\nIt offers no information about how and when an E54 Dimension was established, nor by whom. Knowledge about an instance of E54 Dimension need not be the result of a measurement; it may be the result of evaluating data or other information, which should be documented as an instance of E13 Attribute Assignment.\nAn instance of E54 Dimension is specific to an instance of E70 Thing."@en , "tem dimensão"@pt , "έχει μέγεθος"@el , "有度量规格"@zh , "hat Dimension"@de , "a pour dimension"@fr , "has dimension"@en , "имеет величину"@ru ;
