        sh:description  "This class comprises individual items of a material nature, which live, have lived, or are natural products of or from living organisms.\nArtificial objects that incorporate biological elements, such as Victorian butterfly frames, can be documented as both instances of E20 Biological Object and E22 Human-Made Object."@en ;
