<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#d0e8aa74e5b2909f99d5b93ad83ae7a2>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "有一般用途"@zh , "tem como uso geral"@pt , "had as general use"@en , "a eu pour usage général"@fr , "είχε ως γενική χρήση"@el , "имел основное применение"@ru , "This property associates an instance of E70 Thing with an instance of E55 Type that describes the type of use that it was actually employed for.\nIt allows the relationship between particular things, both physical and immaterial, and the general methods and techniques of real use to be documented. This may well be different from the intended functional purpose of the instance of E70 Thing (which can be documented with P103 was intended for (was intention of)). For example, it could be recorded that a particular wooden crate had a general use as a shelf support on a market stall even though it had been originally intended for carrying vegetables.\nThe use of this property is intended to allow the documentation of usage patterns attested in historical records or through scientific investigation (for instance ceramic residue analysis). It should not be used to document the intended, and thus assumed, use of an object."@en , "hatte die allgemeine Verwendung"@de ;
        sh:class        cidoc-crm:E55_Type ;
        sh:description  "This property associates an instance of E70 Thing with an instance of E55 Type that describes the type of use that it was actually employed for.\nIt allows the relationship between particular things, both physical and immaterial, and the general methods and techniques of real use to be documented. This may well be different from the intended functional purpose of the instance of E70 Thing (which can be documented with P103 was intended for (was intention of)). For example, it could be recorded that a particular wooden crate had a general use as a shelf support on a market stall even though it had been originally intended for carrying vegetables.\nThe use of this property is intended to allow the documentation of usage patterns attested in historical records or through scientific investigation (for instance ceramic residue analysis). It should not be used to document the intended, and thus assumed, use of an object."@en ;
        sh:name         "had as general use"@en , "a eu pour usage général"@fr , "有一般用途"@zh , "имел основное применение"@ru , "hatte die allgemeine Verwendung"@de , "είχε ως γενική χρήση"@el , "tem como uso geral"@pt ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         cidoc-crm:P101_had_as_general_use .

